      {
        "@value": "AGS 4.1: Heading Added in CTRG\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in ELRG\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in LFCN\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in LTCH\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in LUCT\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in RCAG\nAGS 4.1: Heading Added in RESG\nAGS 4.1.1: Example change in CBRG - \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20°C throughout\" to \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20 +/- 2°C throughout\"\nAGS 4.1.1: Example change in CMPG - \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20°C throughout\" to \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20 +/- 2°C throughout\"\nAGS 4.1.1: Example change in MCVG - \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20°C throughout\" to \"Stored at constant water/moisture content for 7 days, then soaked for 7 days, maintained at 20 +/- 2°C throughout\"\nAGS 4.1.1: Miscellaneous in ELRG - Website display order incorrect"
